--- compile ---
  GEN  vmlinux.h
  BPF  build/ch09-pid-doppel.bpf.o
  SKEL build/ch09-pid-doppel.skel.h
  CC   build/ch09-pid-doppel
--- run ---
=== spawning unshare in fresh PID namespace ===
inside: ns_pid=1
=== second unshare ===
inside2: ns_pid=1
=== nested unshare (two levels) ===
outer: ns_pid=1
inner: ns_pid=1
done.
